{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>MUJI 軟糖變「追星神丹」?!</h2>\n<p>最近Threads上瘋傳一款無印良品軟糖，被追星族戲稱為「春夢軟糖」甚至「追星神丹」。有網民聲稱食用後，竟能在夢中與心儀韓星約會，甚至經歷一連串如連續劇般的離奇夢境，令這款原本普通的檸檬薰衣草味軟糖迅速爆紅。帖文一出，瞬間吸引逾十萬人次瀏覽，大批追星族留言表示想立即入貨試試。\n</p>\n<h2>傳聞會夢見心儀偶像</h2>\n<p>糖果含GABA（γ-氨基丁酸）成分，有助抑制過度興奮的神經訊號，幫助人放鬆、減少焦慮，並有助入睡。至於「夢見偶像」的現象，未必與GABA直接相關，這更多可能與心理暗示、睡前反覆想着偶像，以及個人對夢境的記憶和詮釋有關。MUJI官方亦回應，該產品屬普通食品，並非藥品或保健品，效果因人而異，不應一次過大量食用。 有網民則分享，食用後雖然較易入睡，卻因整晚多夢，早上醒來反而更疲倦，提醒大家別把它當成「追星仙丹」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762041982353_8359323246af58e34bc1d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762041982353_8359323246af58e34bc1d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762248066988_16260367256af58e36cf74a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762248066988_16260367256af58e36cf74a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762426596588_14569154236af58e389aa5f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179447762426596588_14569154236af58e389aa5f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfolA3IE7wB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.803331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":466,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:43:31.654199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:38.253887+00:00","content_hash":"c36c1d899a8c9caa739aa2453980ab7f8d16891526e62c13a8ccd912b3e15b37","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}